      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is an example of a pattern we try to avoid in Zuul tests.  It\u0027s testing the implementation details rather than the functional outcome.  Instead, we would normally have this test verify that the node requests are handled the way we want (ie, that a high-priority one is handled before a lower-priority one).  I suspect that if we rewrote this test, it would pass without this change.  We may already have a version of this test.",
